## 2. Helios multiplex (cite)

Helios time-multiplexes sub-graphs onto a physical lattice during decoding stages; each PE switches context via LUTRAM (~1 cycle). Aether micro: **one** physical 2-vertex / 1-edge grow datapath; **two** virtual jobs (ctx0 = two_node, ctx1 = boundary) share that datapath via H9 banks.

